{"id": "DfZ8g9pClXq", "title": "Video by vedastovikings", "description": "“Until I kill Arjuna, no one washes my feet.”\n“जब तक मैं अर्जुन को मार नहीं देता... कोई मेरे पैर नहीं धोएगा।”\n\nBhishma mocked Karna for running from the Gandharvas. Karna's answer: “Four Pandavas conquered the earth. I will conquer it for you, alone.” With the divine weapons Parashurama taught him and the armour no weapon could pierce, he did it: Drupada's city, Bhagadatta's elephants and the Himalaya, the kingdoms of the east, Rukmi in the south, the kings of the western sea. Then, at the sacrifice, he swore the vow that the king of the gods would remember. (Mahabharata, Vana Parva 3.250-255)\n\nThe Brother Who Never Knew, Part 5. Part 6, The Armour: the king of the gods comes to beg.\n\nWas Karna's vow pride or loyalty? Tell me below 👇\n\n#mahabharat #mahabharata #karna #arjuna #duryodhana #महाभारत", "channel": "vedastovikings", "uploader_id": "60997589521", "uploader": "Vedas to Vikings | Mythology films", "timestamp": 1793979559, "like_count": 1088, "comment_count": 17, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/151.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-17959660845037522a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.168, "asr": 48000, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQO6OKiBvRjXaOGxcMV_ZScOBWV3grlGMCQWElS527q8xhW-3NiDxdgj9xR5EYj8szzAvLgc36jk5i8--YLwv_FeFCb-lgIJK1ADvPM.mp4?_nc_cat=104&_nc_oc=AdpY32dCW-6zA2EeHABeJG2S5GWjQaLhMFOJnBCeub3sBJtTjuVwA8_YogzPKovgC_OLS2jldIEgmFUPHGHNz-QH&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=instagram.fblr2-3.fna.fbcdn.net&_nc_ohc=cmF1z8O-jr4Q7kNvwGNrzDn&%3D&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=dWejfcszxVYyFZJvfW_T3A&_n